## Context

Conference deliverable (Econom'IA 2026, 2026-05-27). Produces the Figure 3 currently
placeholder in `slides/manuscript/main.md` §4. Full F1 evaluation is post-conference
(tracked in 0255/H1); this ticket uses the metadata already in the arm summary JSONs.

Canonical data sources:
- `experiments/outputs/sota_exp2_naive_arm/` — Arm 1 (naive, N=5 × 4 agents)
- `experiments/outputs/sota_exp2_brerun1/` — Arm 2 (optimized, corrected classifier)
- `sota_exp2_phase_b_full/` excluded (weak classifier — README says DO NOT USE)

## Actions

1. **`src/aedist/tabulate_exp2_arms.py`** — already exists on t251; verify it reads
   from `sota_exp2_naive_arm/` and `sota_exp2_brerun1/`, emits a CSV with columns:
   `arm, agent, run, classification, narrative_chars, inventory_rows, cost_usd, wall_s`.
   Naive arm JSONs have no `inventory_rows`; emit `None` for those rows.

2. **`src/aedist/plot_exp2_arms_comparison.py`** — new script. Reads the CSV from (1).
   Produces `report/inputs/generated/fig_exp2_arms_comparison.pdf`:
   - Panel A: grouped bar chart — narrative_chars by agent × arm (report-classified runs only)
   - Panel B: grouped bar chart — inventory_rows by agent × arm (optimized arm only, naive = N/A)
   - Panel C: cost_usd by agent × arm
   Style: project palette (`src/aedist/palette.toml`), no inline pgfplots.

3. **`report/exp2-analysis.mk`** — add targets:
   ```
   $(GEN)/tab_exp2_arms.csv: ...sota_exp2_naive_arm/... ...sota_exp2_brerun1/...
       uv run python -m aedist.tabulate_exp2_arms --output $@

   $(GEN)/fig_exp2_arms_comparison.pdf: $(GEN)/tab_exp2_arms.csv
       uv run python -m aedist.plot_exp2_arms_comparison --input $< --output $@
   ```
   Add both to `exp2-analysis-report` phony target dependencies.

4. **`slides/manuscript/main.md`** — replace the Figure 3 placeholder include path with
   `inputs/generated/fig_exp2_arms_comparison.pdf` and update the caption to reflect
   the metadata metrics shown (not the cross-eval rubric scores — those are post-conference).
   Update §4 prose: "three agents × three reps" → "four agents × five reps, two arms".

## Test

- `tests/test_tabulate_exp2_arms.py` — already exists on t251; extend to assert:
  - reads from `sota_exp2_brerun1/` not `sota_exp2_phase_b_full/`
  - `inventory_rows` is `None` for naive arm rows
  - `classification` column present and values in `{report, no_report}`
- `tests/test_plot_exp2_arms_comparison.py` — smoke: script runs with `--dry-run` without error.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `make -f report/exp2-analysis.mk exp2-analysis-report` runs without error
- [ ] `fig_exp2_arms_comparison.pdf` exists and renders three panels
- [ ] `main.md` Figure 3 placeholder replaced with the generated figure path
- [ ] §4 prose agent/rep count updated to match actuals
- [ ] `make check-fast` passes
